==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 61.33 seconds<sup>1,840f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Crazed Axe Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Axe Cat]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
It is highly recommended to bring [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]], [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]] and [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]] to the battle.

It is also recommended that you should have more than two meatshields (such as [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]]). If you have anything that can slow, freeze, or deal good damage to Red or Floating, bring them along. Some examples of useful cats include [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]] and any other Ubers that seem useful. If you have [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]], they would be useful in this stage, so add them into the party too. The main threat is the Shy Boy rush in the beginning of the game, as these Shy Boys are the ones responsible for bringing down your defenses. After the Crazed Axe spawns, that is the real challenge. Most guides recommend collecting and using other crazed cats before this one. Due to the Axe's fast attack rate, damage, and average range, get as many ranged units as you can and don't use nukers since they are very vulnerable.

This should be the last Crazed Cat stage attempted, due to how overwhelming this stage can be, as well as the quality of its reward, [[Crazed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Axe Cat]], who has extremely underwhelming stats for how hard it is to obtain. You will still need to beat this stage to unlock the ability to challenge Manic Stages.

